                <h2 id="faq">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

                <div class="space-y-4 not-prose my-8">
                    <details
                        class="group bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 open:bg-white open:ring-1 open:ring-blue-100 open:shadow-md transition-all"
                    >
                        <summary
                            class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center outline-none"
                        >
                            <span
                                >Will there be more BC PNP nominations added in
                                2026?</span
                            >
                            <span
                                class="transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180 text-blue-500"
                                >▼</span
                            >
                        </summary>
                        <div
                            class="mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-4 animate-fadeIn"
                        >
                            Yes. IRCC added 1,000 nominations on August 18,
                            2026, bringing BC's 2026 allocation to 6,254, and
                            BC PNP plans to use it in full by December 31, 2026.
                            BC's 2027 allocation had not been announced as of
                            November 11, 2026; the 2027–2029 Levels Plan raises
                            the national PNP target to 95,000 a year.
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details
