                        </summary>
                        <div
                            class="mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-4 animate-fadeIn"
                        >
                            Draws resumed in 2026. Since the April 23, 2026
                            restructuring, BC PNP has held Care, Build and
                            Innovate rounds about monthly. As of November 11,
                            2026, the latest were the October 8 Care and Build
                            rounds and the October 29 Innovate round (772
                            invitations). See our <a href="/bc-pnp-draws" class="text-blue-600 underline">draws page</a> for updates.
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details
                        class="group bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 open:bg-white open:ring-1 open:ring-blue-100 open:shadow-md transition-all"
