                        >
                            It depends on the round. In 2026, Care: Health minimums fell from 108 in May to 76 in September and October, Care: Childcare was 99 to 102 from August to October, Build was 88 to 108, and Innovate points rounds were 131 to 138. Innovate also invites by wage alone ($49/hr and $99,000/yr on October 29, 2026).
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details
                        class="group bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 open:bg-white open:ring-1 open:ring-blue-100 open:shadow-md transition-all"
                    >
                        <summary
                            class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center outline-none"
